    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i was thinking about how everything just feels like a loop lately. like, if there's no inherent reason to be here, then staying alive is really just a habit, right? it's like a subscription you forgot to cancel but you're too tired to actually find the button. feels kind of pointless to keep performing the ritual of existing just because you've always done it.",
